WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.652 --> 00:00:17.603
The third had just put away their math books.

2
00:00:18.944 --> 00:00:21.906
Suddenly they heard a buzz from the speaker on the wall.

3
00:00:23.007 --> 00:00:24.688
The voice of the principal, Ms.

4
00:00:24.768 --> 00:00:26.790
Olson, rang through the classroom.

5
00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:29.452
"Joy Donovan, please come to the office."

6
00:00:31.392 --> 00:00:33.033
"Grandpa is here with the chicks!"

7
00:00:33.553 --> 00:00:34.254
cried Joy.

8
00:00:34.274 --> 00:00:37.476
"Hooray!" cheered Katie.

9
00:00:37.496 --> 00:00:39.877
"May I go to the office, Mr.

10
00:00:39.897 --> 00:00:43.099
Higgins?" asked Joy as she jumped up from her desk.

11
00:00:43.119 --> 00:00:46.361
"Yes, you may," said the teacher.

12
00:00:48.102 --> 00:00:49.683
Joy stopped at Katie's desk.

13
00:00:50.263 --> 00:00:53.325
"Go ahead and draw the chicken," she whispered loudly.

14
00:00:54.506 --> 00:00:58.068
Mr. Higgins nodded to Katie, and she walked to the whiteboard.

15
00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:01.583
She took a marker and drew a big chicken.

16
00:01:03.284 --> 00:01:07.508
Just as Katie finished the tail, Joy marched back into the room.

17
00:01:08.048 --> 00:01:11.611
Grandpa walked behind her with a large cardboard box.

18
00:01:11.631 --> 00:01:14.653
"Let's all say hello to Mr.

19
00:01:14.673 --> 00:01:16.475
Donovan," instructed Mr.

20
00:01:16.515 --> 00:01:22.120
Higgins. The third graders clapped and called, "Hello, Mr.

21
00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:27.184
Donovan!" "Hello, kids," Grandpa said, smiling.

22
00:01:28.316 --> 00:01:31.277
He carried the box to a table in the front of the room.

23
00:01:31.837 --> 00:01:33.978
Then he sat down on a small chair.

24
00:01:33.998 --> 00:01:39.659
"I've already seen the chicks," Luke whispered to the boy next to him.

25
00:01:39.679 --> 00:01:42.180
"They're cheeping!"

26
00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:43.961
cried Laura Layman.

27
00:01:45.141 --> 00:01:48.482
Joy walked to the front of the class and stood beside Katie.

28
00:01:48.502 --> 00:01:51.583
"We're going to look at the chicks in the box.

29
00:01:52.183 --> 00:01:55.164
But first Katie will tell you about her drawing."

30
00:01:56.892 --> 00:02:00.515
"In five or six months, these little chicks will look like this.

31
00:02:01.116 --> 00:02:03.017
This is a grown-up hen.

32
00:02:04.078 --> 00:02:08.041
That's what you call a female chicken," Katie explained to the class.

33
00:02:08.061 --> 00:02:10.563
"Here is the hen's beak."

34
00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:12.625
She pointed to the whiteboard.

35
00:02:12.645 --> 00:02:16.548
"This wavy thing on top is called a comb."

36
00:02:17.129 --> 00:02:18.830
She tapped her finger on the comb.

37
00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:23.194
"And this floppy part under the beak is called a wattle."

38
00:02:23.214 --> 00:02:26.700
"Cool," said Luke.

39
00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:28.301
"Where are the feet?"

40
00:02:29.541 --> 00:02:31.001
The whole class laughed.

41
00:02:31.441 --> 00:02:35.343
Katie had run out of space on the board and hadn't drawn the feet.

42
00:02:35.363 --> 00:02:39.104
"You're silly, Luke," replied Katie.

43
00:02:39.124 --> 00:02:42.244
"Thank you, Katie," said Mr.

44
00:02:42.264 --> 00:02:44.585
Higgins. "That was very helpful."

45
00:02:45.905 --> 00:02:47.226
Now it was Joy's turn.

46
00:02:47.246 --> 00:02:50.387
"Our chicks aren't grown up yet," she said.

47
00:02:50.407 --> 00:02:53.027
"They're about two weeks old."

48
00:02:53.647 --> 00:02:55.368
She lifted the lid off the box.

49
00:02:56.968 --> 00:03:01.251
All the third graders jumped out of their seats and gathered around the box.

50
00:03:01.271 --> 00:03:04.334
"Hey!" exclaimed Luke.

51
00:03:04.894 --> 00:03:06.195
"Their hair looks funny.

52
00:03:06.495 --> 00:03:07.516
It's sticking out."

53
00:03:09.117 --> 00:03:12.539
The chicks were cheeping and hopping around inside the box.

54
00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:15.782
Joy lifted a chick from the box.

55
00:03:15.802 --> 00:03:19.324
"They're getting real feathers on their tails and wings."

56
00:03:19.344 --> 00:03:24.288
"This one has little horns," exclaimed one of her classmates.

57
00:03:25.904 --> 00:03:29.427
"That is where its comb is starting to grow," explained Joy.

58
00:03:29.447 --> 00:03:33.831
"Why do some have white legs and some have yellow legs?"

59
00:03:34.371 --> 00:03:34.971
asked Luke.

60
00:03:34.991 --> 00:03:38.114
"They're just different," said Joy.

61
00:03:38.134 --> 00:03:41.036
"Are the two white ones twins?"

62
00:03:41.637 --> 00:03:42.317
asked Laura.

63
00:03:42.337 --> 00:03:43.678
"They look alike."

64
00:03:43.698 --> 00:03:48.762
"They look alike, but they're not the same," said Katie.

65
00:03:49.903 --> 00:03:53.506
She picked up one of the white chicks and put it in Laura's hand.

66
00:03:53.526 --> 00:04:00.291
"This one is nice and calm, but the other one―" The other white chick chirped and ran around

67
00:04:00.371 --> 00:04:01.031
in circles.

68
00:04:03.012 --> 00:04:07.295
Everyone looked closely into the box as the chick tripped over the feeder.

69
00:04:07.795 --> 00:04:09.776
It knocked into some of the other chicks.

70
00:04:11.077 --> 00:04:12.017
"What's it doing?"

71
00:04:12.438 --> 00:04:13.058
asked Luke.

72
00:04:14.279 --> 00:04:18.681
Suddenly the squawking chick jumped and flapped its little wings.

73
00:04:18.701 --> 00:04:21.943
"It's trying to fly!"

74
00:04:21.963 --> 00:04:22.764
cried Laura.

75
00:04:24.616 --> 00:04:25.897
All the children laughed.

76
00:04:25.917 --> 00:04:29.098
"See?" said Joy.

77
00:04:29.118 --> 00:04:30.799
"The chicks look alike.

78
00:04:31.159 --> 00:04:32.400
But they're really different."

79
00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:34.961
"Just like us!"

80
00:04:35.561 --> 00:04:37.022
Katie couldn't help saying.

81
00:04:37.042 --> 00:04:40.944
"Hooray for Katie and Joy's chicks!"

82
00:04:40.964 --> 00:04:41.664
Laura said.

83
00:04:41.684 --> 00:04:45.105
All the third graders clapped and cheered.

84
00:04:45.926 --> 00:04:48.367
Katie and Joy looked at each other and smiled.

85
00:04:48.967 --> 00:04:50.288
Then they cheered too!
